// SFX — Eraser (eraser strokes on the canvas; one-shot per stroke)
// Status: DONE (owner-approved 2026-07-19, v3 "chalkboard scrubbing")
// Three soft wiping strokes, the first slightly longer — mid-band filtered noise with soft
// attacks so they read as RUBBING, not tapping. Chalkboard-eraser reference (owner).
// Knobs: bpf lower (~800) = more felt-on-board; higher (~1500) = squeakier.
// Render: one hit, WAV. Audition plays once per second.
// Paste into https://strudel.cc — spec: TDD/sound/stinger-sfx-spec.md

setcpm(60)

sound("[pink pink pink]@2 ~ ~")
  .attack(.04).decay(.09).sustain(0)
  .bpf(1100).bpq(2)
  .gain(.4)
